WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Welcome to Serene Flow Yoga.

00:04.000 --> 00:08.000
Find a comfortable position and soften your shoulders.

00:08.000 --> 00:12.000
Take a slow breath in.

00:12.000 --> 00:16.000
And gently breathe out.

00:16.000 --> 00:20.000
Move at a pace that feels comfortable for you.

00:20.000 --> 00:24.000
Stay present with your breath and your body.
